  "title": " RND  was founded in 2018, To provide a tailored solution to every sector irrespective of any discrimination. ",
  "description": "<h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">Welcome to RND Technosoft!&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">RND Technosoft was founded in 2018, and it has focused on being a company that delivers solutions that are unique to address the needs of the startups and the incubation companies as well as the established organizations in the market. It is our goal to help companies increase their performance with fresh concepts, practical strategies, and Technical use.&nbsp;</h3><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">Since our establishment, our primary focus has been to provide professional software development solutions which ensure success in the client’s initiatives. At our company, a team of highly qualified specialists is committed to the constant development of the offered services on the basis of new technologies and achievements in the field of the industry.&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">In RND Technosoft, our competency is to attain benchmarks in the software development front. This commitment to excellence, in tandem with the right business strategy that places our clients’ needs foremost, has allowed us to foster long term business relations with our clients and has given us many achievements in a relatively short period of time.&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">From the first steps of a start up in the market or when an existing business plans for changes and expansions, RND Technosoft is ready to back it up. Come and feel the difference of having dedicated employees working for you, creative professionals thinking for you and a competitive team working only for you.</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\">Together, let's turn your visions into reality.</h3><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p>Ravi Shah</p><p>CEO and Founder</p>",
